    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like there's anyone to call... we're all trapped in here. the guards won't let anyone out, and the city is already dead, it just hasn't stopped breathing yet. i just feel so empty. like there's nothing left to protect. why am i even trying to stay awake? it just makes the waiting harder.",
